---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { path } from '../i18n/routes';
---

<BaseLayout lang="nl" page="sponsors" title="Sponsors">
<section class="night" style="position:relative;padding-top:clamp(80px,10vw,144px);overflow:hidden"><img class="hero-media" src="/assets/slaap-expo_foto268.jpg" alt="" width="1920" height="1280"><div class="shade-side" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wrap" style="position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;padding-bottom:clamp(64px,8vw,104px)"><h1 style="font-size:clamp(40px,5.6vw,72px);font-weight:800;color:#FFFFFF;max-width:920px">Sponsors en exposanten</h1><p class="lead" style="color:#C9CDE3;max-width:760px">SLAAP2027 wordt mede mogelijk gemaakt door onze sponsors. Met circa 600 deelnemers uit onderzoek en zorg ontmoet je hier de Nederlandse slaapgemeenschap.</p><div style="margin-top:8px"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:info@jcc-congressen.nl?subject=Sponsoring%20SLAAP2027">Sponsor worden</a></div></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="wrap" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:56px"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><h2 class="h3">Platinum sponsors</h2><ul class="grid" style="list-style:none;gap:16px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(240px,100%),1fr))"><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:150px;font-size:17px">[Logo]</li><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:150px;font-size:17px">[Logo]</li><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:150px;font-size:17px">[Logo]</li><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:150px;font-size:17px">[Logo]</li></ul></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><h2 class="h3">Gold sponsors</h2><ul class="grid" style="list-style:none;gap:16px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(180px,100%),1fr))"><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:110px;font-size:16px">[Logo]</li><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:110px;font-size:16px">[Logo]</li><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:110px;font-size:16px">[Logo]</li><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:110px;font-size:16px">[Logo]</li><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:110px;font-size:16px">[Logo]</li><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:110px;font-size:16px">[Logo]</li></ul></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><h2 class="h3">Silver sponsors</h2><ul class="grid" style="list-style:none;gap:16px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(140px,100%),1fr))"><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:88px;font-size:15px">[Logo]</li><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:88px;font-size:15px">[Logo]</li><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:88px;font-size:15px">[Logo]</li><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:88px;font-size:15px">[Logo]</li><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:88px;font-size:15px">[Logo]</li><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:88px;font-size:15px">[Logo]</li><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:88px;font-size:15px">[Logo]</li><li class="logo-tile" style="min-height:88px;font-size:15px">[Logo]</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="sec" style="background:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #DADDE8"><div class="wrap grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(420px,100%),1fr));gap:clamp(40px,6vw,88px);align-items:start"><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><h2 class="h2">Sponsor worden</h2><p class="lead muted">Interesse in sponsoring of een stand op SLAAP2027? Neem contact op met <em class="ph">[naam contactpersoon]</em> van JCC Congress Consultancy.</p><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px"><a class="btn btn-dark" href="mailto:info@jcc-congressen.nl?subject=Sponsoring%20SLAAP2027"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 7l9 6 9-6"></path></svg>info@jcc-congressen.nl</a></div></div><div class="panel" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;background:#F3F4F9"><h3 class="h3">Gedragscode Geneesmiddelenreclame (CGR)</h3><p class="muted" style="font-size:16px">Het publiek van SLAAP2027 bestaat uit professionals en niet-professionals. Daarom is alleen corporate branding toegestaan, zonder productinformatie. Op de badges staat de functie van deelnemers, zodat je gerichte gesprekken kunt voeren.</p><p class="muted" style="font-size:16px">Sponsorbijdragen dekken uitsluitend de organisatiekosten en het wetenschappelijke programma. Een eventueel overschot uit registratiegelden gaat naar Stichting Slaapcongres Nederland voor toekomstige congressen. We handelen volgens de AVG en de <a href="https://www.cgr.nl">Gedragscode Geneesmiddelenreclame</a>.</p></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
